 de Vila Real (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Prazo Oficial:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/01\/2027 \u00e0s 24:00)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada S. Silvestre Cidade de Vila Real (5 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 9 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Prazo Oficial:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 04\/01\/2027 \u00e0s 24:00)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a XX S. Silvestre Cidade de Vila Real 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A XX S. Silvestre Cidade de Vila Real realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 9 de janeiro de 2027. A II S\u00e3o Silvestre da Pequenada arranca a partir das 16:00 na Avenida Carvalho Ara\u00fajo, enquanto a Corrida de 10 km e a Caminhada de 5 km partem \u00e0s 18:00 do Regimento de Infantaria n\u00ba 13 com chegada na Avenida Carvalho Ara\u00fajo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e escal\u00f5es dispon\u00edveis no programa?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende a Corrida principal de 10 km (para atletas nascidos em 2009 e anteriores, Sub-20, Absolutos e Veteranos V35 a V55), a Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 5 km aberta a todas as idades e a II S\u00e3o Silvestre da Pequenada com tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias jovens: 600 m (Sub-10\/12), 900 m (Sub-14) e 1800 m (Sub-16\/18).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e prazos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Corrida de 10 km tem o custo de 15,00 \u20ac e na Caminhada de 5 km custa 7,00 \u20ac, com prazo at\u00e9 \u00e0s 24:00 do dia 4 de janeiro de 2027 (kit de participante garantido para as primeiras 600 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e uso obrigat\u00f3rio da t-shirt t\u00e9cnica). As corridas jovens da Pequenada s\u00e3o gratuitas com inscri\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 5 de janeiro de 2027.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento de dorsais e kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na Sede da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Vila Real na sexta-feira, 8 de janeiro de 2027, das 14:30 \u00e0s 19:00, e no s\u00e1bado, dia 9 de janeiro de 2027, no Regimento de Infantaria n\u00ba 13 (junto ao local de partida), entre as 16:00 e as 17:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite da prova e quem organiza o evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Corrida principal de 10 km e a Caminhada de 5 km t\u00eam uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima regulamentar de 90 minutos (1h30). A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o pertence \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Real, ao Regimento de Infantaria n\u00ba 13 e \u00e0 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Vila Real, com apoio da Funda\u00e7\u00e3o Inatel e da Junta de Freguesia de Vila Real.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"XX S. Silvestre Cidade de Vila Real 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-09\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-09\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Regimento de Infantaria n\u00ba 13 \/ Avenida Carvalho Ara\u00fajo, Vila Real\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Real\", \"addressRegion\": \"Vila Real\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A XX S. Silvestre Cidade de Vila Real 2027 realiza-se a 9 de janeiro em Vila Real. Corrida de 10 km, Caminhada de 5 km e Pequenada. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-xvi-s-silvestre-cidade-de-vila-real.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S. Silvestre da Pequenada Sub-10\/12 (600 m)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.cyclonessports.com\/index.php\/379-xx-s-silvestre-cidade-de-vila-real-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S. Silvestre da Pequenada Sub-14 (900 m)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.cyclonessports.com\/i